    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DogPunk is a sci-fi shooter set in a distant future where companies rush to create cutting-edge weapons to arm themselves and hurt others. In this high-octane first-person shooter, the player is a dog-headed super soldier trying to escape from containment by their captor, the Lab by Predator Tec. Battle through trials with various environments and enemies, and maneuver your character with the fluid parkour system.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/ae4c3656481dc3275e1a2b0325ad311d.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/ae4c3656481dc3275e1a2b0325ad311d.webm?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/ae4c3656481dc3275e1a2b0325ad311d.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and dodge around enemy fire using movement abilities such as double jump, wall run, and grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4e7e98ae72dfc5dbc5f61dc8f82e109d.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4e7e98ae72dfc5dbc5f61dc8f82e109d.webm?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4e7e98ae72dfc5dbc5f61dc8f82e109d.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize two weapons and combat abilities that give you an edge over the enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/7e26cbc10e45aef8c47e1433bcdaf70e.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/7e26cbc10e45aef8c47e1433bcdaf70e.webm?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/7e26cbc10e45aef8c47e1433bcdaf70e.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout and select from 10 different abilities, such as time dilation and gravitational surge, to fit your playstyle. Use them in tandem with your movement to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/5e8626d3e691a7b2e74b9bd25273ef0d.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/5e8626d3e691a7b2e74b9bd25273ef0d.webm?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/5e8626d3e691a7b2e74b9bd25273ef0d.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in over 15 randomized and diverse environments that require quick thinking and reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/f19fe63e5c1be273e8754a607def7065.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/f19fe63e5c1be273e8754a607def7065.webm?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/f19fe63e5c1be273e8754a607def7065.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with enemies on both the ground and air, with various modifiers such as dodge and shield that bring new challenges.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DogPunk is a sci-fi shooter set in a distant future where companies rush to create cutting-edge weapons to arm themselves and hurt others. In this high-octane first-person shooter, the player is a dog-headed super soldier trying to escape from containment by their captor, the Lab by Predator Tec. Battle through trials with various environments and enemies, and maneuver your character with the fluid parkour system.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/ae4c3656481dc3275e1a2b0325ad311d.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/ae4c3656481dc3275e1a2b0325ad311d.webm?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/ae4c3656481dc3275e1a2b0325ad311d.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and dodge around enemy fire using movement abilities such as double jump, wall run, and grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/4e7e98ae72dfc5dbc5f61dc8f82e109d.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap