tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/5e8626d3e691a7b2e74b9bd25273ef0d.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in over 15 randomized and diverse environments that require quick thinking and reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/f19fe63e5c1be273e8754a607def7065.poster.avif?t=1747018611\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/f19fe63e5c1be273e8754a607def7065.webm?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665510/extras/f19fe63e5c1be273e8754a607def7065.mp4?t=1747018611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with enemies on both the ground and air, with various modifiers such as dodge and shield that bring new challenges.</p>",
